            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "■ 三段功率叠加开关调色：L1→L2→L1+L2"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                149,
                828,
                164
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "■ 极简外围，无需任何外围元件"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                514,
                170,
                752,
                185
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "■ 铝基板漏电检测技术"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                514,
                190,
                692,
                205
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "■ 成熟的开关检测技术，性能稳定"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                514,
                210,
                766,
                225
